; The ONE variable: which rect a Control anchors against when the CanvasItem
; chain BREAKS at its direct parent. A plain `Node` fails `get_parent_item()`'s
; cast, so `data.parent_canvas_item` is null and `get_parent_anchorable_rect`
; falls through to the viewport's own visible rect (control.cpp:685-711) —
; the Control escapes the enclosing Panel and anchors to the screen. The
; sibling fixture moves the same variable to a Node2D link, where the fallback
; is the zero rect instead.

